+# Project
+
+- Name: projectname
+- Purpose: TODO one line
+- Stack: Python (prototype tier), argparse CLI, uv + ruff + pyright + pytest, nix dev shell
+- Entry point: `projectname` console script -> src/projectname_pkg/cli.py (main)
